ly discovered endpoint labels.\n* Adds validation for required parameters, licensing constraints, endpoint availability, and duplicate inputs.\n* Adds **Test Connection** to the Meraki organization setup.\n* Improves input visibility with sourcetype, collection interval, recommended interval, and per-input diagnostic-level details.\n* Expands Data Collection Health coverage for Custom API inputs.\n\n## Security and packaging\n\n* Updates the bundled urllib3 dependency to 2.7.0.\n* Adds packaging checks for stale or duplicate urllib3 distributions.\n* Adds version and build numbers to release archive names.\n* Regenerates third-party software notices from the packaged dependencies.\n\n## Platform requirements\n\n* Requires Splunk Enterprise or Splunk Cloud Platform 10.2 or later.\n* Requires the Splunk Python 3.13 runtime.\n\n## Upgrade notes\n\n* Existing organization settings, inputs, and checkpoints remain compatible.\n* Custom API inputs are not created automatically and remain disabled until configured and enabled.\n* Meraki syslog ingestion is not included in version 3.5.0.", "passed_validation": true, "path": "https://splunkbase.splunk.com/app/5580/release/3.5.0/download/", "platform": "independent", "product_compatibility": "splunk", "product_types": ["enterprise", "cloud"], "published_time": "2026-09-24T16:56:43.399657Z", "release_id": 124387, "release_name": "3.5.0", "sha256": "edd12274203a367e73c8f3ae2115ad18008b6f20f46614602b724fc7758ac8e8", "size": 28854766, "spl_compatibility": "SPL1", "tags_sourcetypes": {"__no_tag__": ["meraki:wirelessdeviceswirelesscontrollersbydevice", "meraki:wirelessdevicesethernetstatuses", "meraki:webhooklogs:api", "meraki:switchportsoverview", "meraki:summarytopswitchesbyenergyusage", "meraki:summarytopdevicesbyusage", "meraki:summarytopclientsbyusage", "meraki:summarytopappliancesbyutilization", "meraki:summaryswitchpowerhistory", "meraki:sensorreadingshistory", "meraki:portstransceiversreadingshistorybyswitch", "meraki:organi